## Appendix — troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause |
| --- | --- |
| A code column is all zeros across every run | Criteria unsatisfiable as written, or the code's evidence lives in a field the coder isn't shown (usually `context_stem`) |
| C04 never fires on the bar facet | `stated_bar` empty in Pass 1 — go back to 2.2, item 3 |
| Change codes fire on units with no prior counterpart | Gate not enforced; assert it in the validator rather than the prompt |
| Between-model α high, human-versus-model α low | The codebook is specific but is measuring something other than what you intend — the most dangerous failure, and invisible without the human subsample |
| Within-model α below 1.0 at temperature 0 | Check the call actually set temperature; some interfaces ignore it |
| Unit counts differ between two runs of A1 on the same document | You re-segmented. Use the frozen file |
| Output truncates mid-batch | Reduce batch size to 15; do not increase max tokens and hope |